","instruction":"I am rewriting LightingPass to remove all RenderGraph dependencies. Key changes: (1) inherit RenderPassBase instead of RenderGraphPassBase, (2) Initialize() becomes Setup(), (3) AcquireResource() and DeclareResourceUsage() are removed, (4) Render() becomes Execute(), (5) resourceHandle.* becomes resources.*, (6) shadowMapRenderer.Record() is split into SetupResources() + BuildRendererLists() called in PrepareRendererLists(), (7) RenderGraph field is removed, (8) Forward+ tile buffer allocation moved to Setup via resources.AllocateForwardPlusTileBuffer().","apply_mode":"apply_only"}},"timestamp":1775754890,"type":"TOOL_CALL_ARGS"}

