{"rawEvent":{"message_id":"019d7c300835763e854ea44381eaf316","conversation_id":"019d6e17fc1f7daabf5314974e3bb0d5","tool_call_id":"tooluse_Ogpj8sQfPkbbw4K6tEKmbl","document":{"file_path":"/Users/archerdu/UnityProject/ArcToonRP/Packages/com.arctoon.render-pipeline/ChatLogs/Design/RenderResources-Refactoring-Analysis.md","sub_content":"RenderResources-Refactoring-Analysis.md","sub_content_event":"open_editor","sub_content_event_value":"/Users/archerdu/UnityProject/ArcToonRP/Packages/com.arctoon.render-pipeline/ChatLogs/Design/RenderResources-Refactoring-Analysis.md","sub_content_tip":"/Users/archerdu/UnityProject/ArcToonRP/Packages/com.arctoon.render-pipeline/ChatLogs/Design/RenderResources-Refactoring-Analysis.md","apply_content":"# RenderResources 重构分析报告

> **日期**: 2026-04-11 
> **背景**: 项目已从 RenderGraph 模式迁移到直接 CommandBuffer 执行模式。原 `RenderGraphResourceHandle` 被替换为 `RenderResources`，但核心架构问题（Layer 2: 全局可变状态容器）被原样继承。本报告分析该问题的严重程度，并提出多种改进方案。

---

## 一、问题诊断：RenderResources 是否存在 God Object 问题？

### 1.1 当前架构概览

```mermaid
graph TD
 CR[CameraRenderer] -->|owns| RR[RenderResources]
 CR -->|passes RR to| EP[ExecutePass]
 EP -->|Setup| RPB[RenderPassBase]
 RPB -->|stores ref| RR

 subgraph "All Passes share the same RenderResources"
 LP[LightingPass] -->|reads/writes| RR
 SP[SetupPass] -->|reads| RR
 DP[DepthStencilPrePass] -->|reads| RR
 OP[OpaquePass] -->|inherits ref, unused| RR
 SKP[SkyboxPass] -->|inherits ref, unused| RR
 TP[TransparentPass] -->|reads| RR
 PFX[PostFXPass] -->|reads/writes| RR
 CFP[CopyFinalPass] -->|reads| RR
 SMP[ShadowMapRenderer] -->|reads| RR
 BP[BloomPass] -->|reads/writes/allocates| RR
 CGP[ColorGradingPass] -->|reads/writes/allocates| RR
 AAP[AntiAliasingPass] -->|reads/writes| RR
 end
```

### 1.2 资源访问矩阵

通过静态分析所有 Pass 对 `resources.*` 的访问，得到以下矩阵：

| 资源字段 | Setup | DepthPre | Opaque | Skybox | Transparent | PostFX | CopyFinal | Lighting | ShadowMap | Bloom | ColorGrading | AA |
|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|
| `colorAttachment` | ✅ | ✅ | ❌ | ❌ | ✅ | ✅ | ❌ | ❌ | ❌ | ✅ | ❌ | ❌ |
| `depthAttachment` | ✅ | ✅ | ❌ | ❌ | ✅ | ❌ | ❌ | ❌ | ❌ | ❌ | ❌ | ❌ |
