{"messageId":"019cf70f84677fa981eae94f60a132e7","rawEvent":{"message_id":"019cf70f84677fa981eae94f60a132e7","conversation_id":"019cd89c39837be2b8cd50af50b21364","content":"`TWO_PI` 在 Unity 的 `com.unity.render-pipelines.core/ShaderLibrary/Common.hlsl` 中已经定义（包含在 `Packages/com.unity.render-pipelines.core/ShaderLibrary/Macros.hlsl` 中）。而项目的 `Common.hlsl` include 了 Unity 的 `Common.hlsl`，且 `Shadow.hlsl` include 了项目的 `Common.hlsl`，所以 `TWO_PI` 是可用的。

但需要注意的是，`PoissonDisk.hlsl` 被 include 在 `Common.hlsl` **之前**（Shadow.hlsl 第34行 include PoissonDisk，第35行才 include Common.hlsl）。这意味着 `PoissonDisk.hlsl` 中的 `InterleavedGradientNoise` 和 `VogelDiskSample` 定义时，`TWO_PI` 还不可用。不过实际上这两个函数只是定义不会在 include 时执行——但 `PoissonDisk.hlsl` 中的函数在调用时是在 `Shadow.hlsl` 的 Filter 函数中，此时 `Common.hlsl` 已经被 include 过了。

让我再检查一下 include 顺序是否有问题："},"timestamp":1773671639,"type":"TEXT_MESSAGE_CONTENT"}

{"messageId":"019cf70f84677fa981eae94f60a132e7","rawEvent":{"message_id":"019cf70f84677fa981eae94f60a132e7","conversation_id":"019cd89c39837be2b8cd50af50b21364","content":"`TWO_PI` 定义在 `Macros.hlsl` 中，而 `Macros.hlsl` 被 `Common.hlsl` include。现在关键问题是：`Shadow.hlsl` 中 `TWO_PI` 出现在哪些行？它们都在 `#include "Common.hlsl"`（第35行）之后吗？

从之前的 grep 结果来看，`TWO_PI` 使用在第 223、243、263、284、314、347、380、414 行——都远在第 35 行之后。但问题在于，**HLSL 的预处理器是按文本顺序工作的**。所有 `#include` 会被展开为一个大文件，然后宏替换按从上到下顺序进行。由于 `Shadow.hlsl` 先 include `PoissonDisk.hlsl`（第32行），再 include `Common.hlsl`（第35行），但 `TWO_PI` 的使用是在 Filter 函数中（远在 include 之后），所以 `TWO_PI` 在使用时已经被定义了。**这没有问题。**

但还有另一个潜在问题：`InterleavedGradientNoise` 定义在 `PoissonDisk.hlsl` 中（在 `Common.hlsl` include 之前），而 Unity Core 中可能已经有 `InterleavedGradientNoise` 的定义。让我检查一下："},"timestamp":1773671856,"type":"TEXT_MESSAGE_CONTENT"}

{"rawEvent":{"message_id":"019cf71cce957e7aa0a9d362c9ba2ec1","conversation_id":"019cd89c39837be2b8cd50af50b21364","tool_call_id":"tooluse_a1lxFcCZCI3zStFoMtoSeG","document":{"file_path":"/Users/archerdu/UnityProject/ArcToonRP/Packages/com.arctoon.render-pipeline/ShaderLibrary/PoissonDisk.hlsl","sub_content":"PoissonDisk.hlsl","sub_content_event":"open_editor","sub_content_event_value":"/Users/archerdu/UnityProject/ArcToonRP/Packages/com.arctoon.render-pipeline/ShaderLibrary/PoissonDisk.hlsl","sub_content_tip":"/Users/archerdu/UnityProject/ArcToonRP/Packages/com.arctoon.render-pipeline/ShaderLibrary/PoissonDisk.hlsl","apply_content":"
#ifndef ARCTOON_POISSON_DISK_INCLUDED
#define ARCTOON_POISSON_DISK_INCLUDED

#define POISSON_SAMPLE_COUNT 16

// Uncomment to enable runtime Vogel Disk sampling with per-pixel random rotation.
// This eliminates regular banding artifacts at the cost of slight noise.
// Comment out to fall back to precomputed Poisson Disk array.
// #define POISSON_DISK_RUNTIME

#if defined(POISSON_DISK_RUNTIME)

// Golden Angle in radians (~2.3999632)
#define GOLDEN_ANGLE 2.3999632297286533

// Screen-space interleaved gradient noise for per-pixel randomization
float _PoissonDisk_InterleavedGradientNoise(float2 screenPos)
{
 float3 magic = float3(0.06711056, 0.00583715, 52.9829189);
 return frac(magic.z * frac(dot(screenPos, magic.xy)));
}

// Non-const array, will be filled at runtime by InitPoissonDisk
static float2 poissonDisk[POISSON_SAMPLE_COUNT];

// Call this before accessing poissonDisk[].
// screenPos: pixel screen-space coordinate (e.g. positionSTS.xy * atlasSize)
void InitPoissonDisk(float2 screenPos)
{
 float rotation = _PoissonDisk_InterleavedGradientNoise(screenPos) * 6.28318530718; // TWO_PI
 for (int i = 0; i < POISSON_SAMPLE_COUNT; i++)
 {
 float r = sqrt((float)i + 0.5) / sqrt((float)POISSON_SAMPLE_COUNT);
 float theta = (float)i * GOLDEN_ANGLE + rotation;
 poissonDisk[i] = float2(r * cos(theta), r * sin(theta));
 }
}

#else // Precomputed mode

static const float2 poissonDisk[POISSON_SAMPLE_COUNT] =
{
 float2(-0.94201624, -0.39906216),
 float2( 0.94558609, -0.76890725),
 float2(-0.09418410, -0.92938870),
 float2( 0.34495938, 0.29387760),
 float2(-0.91588581, 0.45771432),
 float2(-0.81544232, -0.87912464),
 float2(-0.38277543, 0.27676845),
 float2( 0.97484398, 0.75648379),
 float2( 0.44323325, -0.97511554),
 float2( 0.53742981, -0.47373420),
 float2(-0.26496911, -0.41893023),
 float2( 0.79197514, 0.19090188),
 float2(-0.24188840, 0.99706507),
 float2(-0.81409955, 0.91437590),
 float2( 0.19984126, 0.78641367),
 float2( 0.14383161, -0.14100790)
};

// No-op in precomputed mode. Exists so callers can invoke unconditionally.
void InitPoissonDisk(float2 screenPos) {}

#endif // POISSON_DISK_RUNTIME

#endif // ARCTOON_POISSON_DISK_INCLUDED
","instruction":"I'm rewriting PoissonDisk.hlsl to support two modes controlled by the POISSON_DISK_RUNTIME macro (internal only). Both modes expose the same poissonDisk array and POISSON_SAMPLE_COUNT. Runtime mode adds an InitPoissonDisk function that fills the array with rotated Vogel Disk samples; precomputed mode provides a no-op InitPoissonDisk so Shadow.hlsl can call it unconditionally. All comments in English.","apply_mode":"apply_only"}},"timestamp":1773672449,"type":"TOOL_CALL_ARGS"}

